{"id":"vod_bf_23555","vodId":"23555","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"魔动王","name_cn":"魔动王","date":"1989-01-01","year":"1989","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-24/4b633582e0ec85a28d273e4524cd525e.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在遥远的月球之上，彼时，那里已经变成了适宜人类居住的星球。某日，来月球旅行的遥大地（松冈洋子 配音）邂逅了名为“兔人”的月球种族，他们告诉遥大地，他们位于月球内层的星球遭到了邪动族的侵略都和霸占，为此，他们踏上了寻找能够对抗邪动族的勇士的旅程。　　让兔人们没有想到的是，遥大地竟然就是他们要找的光明魔动战士，通过魔法阵，遥大地召唤出了地之魔动王。之后，召唤出风之魔动王的山本加斯（松田辰也 配音），召唤出水之魔动王的玛利乌斯（安达忍 配音）等人纷纷登场，一行人来到了圣地路那，准备在那里展开一段惊心动魄的奇幻旅程。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 02:42:40","playable":true,"episodeCount":41,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/modongwang/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/modongwang/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/modongwang/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/modongwang/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/modongwang/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/modongwang/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/modongwang/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/modongwang/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/modongwang/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/modongwang/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/modongwang/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/modongwang/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/modongwang/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/modongwang/第14集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/modongwang/第15集